{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 23, :comments ["<b>And for the sacrifice of peace-offerings, two cattle.</b> Corresponding to Moses and Aaron, who established peace between Israel and their Father in heaven." "<b>Rams, lambs, and goats.</b> Three species corresponding to priests, Levites, and Israelites; and corresponding to Torah, Prophets, and Writings. Three sets of five corresponding to the five chumashin and the five commandments written on one tablet and the five written on the second. Up to here is the foundation of Rabbi Moses the Darshan."], :book :numbers, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 7, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T09:09:50.696866044Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}